Z||000018||skitime||07-22-2001||09:57 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroSoul:<BR><B>  Hey Ski,<BR>  What about using the 2 front honey comb grilles off of a Gran Prix or is it a Bonneville?  The beveled bottom shape would match the bevel on the top of the glass.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I am sure you could use grills from anythingand it would be functional. I am always trying to make the car appear to look like it was factory. (To the non-Fiero people) I was only going to do it if the grills matched exactly. That is why I constructed out of the factory grills.  BTW you would not believe the heat that comes from that grill.  It gets hotter than the side grills.<P>||||reg||1
